fullDescription:
Drawing realistic watercolors in Procreate has never been so easy.

Create gorgeous realistic digital watercolor paintings in Procreate with ease and fun, for yourself or for sale!

ViDEO INSTRUCTIONS ADDED

Do a little check first:

– Just check that you have installed your Ipad updates;
– Update your Procreate APP to Procreate 5 and higher;
– Install brushes, palettes and templates and start painting.

ZIP INCLUDES:

– 3 Procreate templates for painting A4 size, 2480 pixels x 3508 pixels, 300 DPI ;
– 11 watercolor realistic Procreate brushes (for painting, lettering & realistic splashes);
– 12 color palettes ;
– Instructions in .pdf format;

Secret video tutorial. You will also get the SECRET VIDEO TUTORIAL. I will show you how to remove the paper —background in order to export your watercolors to .png on a transparent background.
Thanks for watching & happy creating. Feel free to pop me a message anytime! If you have any questions, I’ll be glad to answer the 🙂
